ulator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids shows November to December under 90% of normal in 37 of the 75 years from 1951 to 2025. In 2025, August to September came in at 44% of normal on the middle, and July to August at 59%. So far in 2026, it went the other way, with April to May at 193% of normal and March to April at 186%.</p>"}
